<section id="multiplayer" class="section">
  <div class="mp-head reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow-mono" style="justify-content:center">Multiplayer</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">AI stopped being single-player.</h2>
    <p class="sec-lead">The best work tools all went multiplayer. Google Docs beat Word. Figma beat Photoshop. AI is still mostly private chats and read-only links, even as agents take on long jobs that touch the whole team. Houston puts that work where everyone can see it and step in.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mp-split reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="mp-contrast">
      <div class="mp-block">
        <span class="mp-tag">Single-player AI</span>
        <p>Every chat lives in one person's account. To share, you send a screenshot or a read-only link. When an agent runs for hours, no one else can watch it, steer it, or take over.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mp-block mp-block-ink">
        <span class="mp-tag mp-tag-ink">Houston</span>
        <p>Your agents live in a workspace the whole team shares. Everyone opens the same mission board, jumps into any shared agent, and picks up a mission right where it stands.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-visual">
      <div class="media-slot media-slot-portrait">
        <span class="media-slot-tag">AI image</span>
        <div class="media-slot-inner">
          <svg class="media-slot-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"/></svg>
          <p class="media-slot-cap">image: the share sheet on one agent, adding a teammate as manager or someone who can use it</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mp-grid reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></span>
      <h3>One workspace your whole team shares</h3>
      <p>Keep your personal space, and add team spaces beside it. Switch between them in a click, and everyone in a team space works from the same agents.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Share any agent in a click</h3>
      <p>Open the share sheet and add a teammate as someone who can use the agent, or someone who can manage it. The agent keeps its history and skills.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Everyone sees the same missions</h3>
      <p>One mission board for the team. See who started each mission and who pitched in, and pick up any mission from where it stands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Roles that keep it safe</h3>
      <p>Owner, Manager, and Member roles decide who can add people, create agents, and change settings. Members just use what they are given.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="21" y2="14"/><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="10" y2="3"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="21" y2="12"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="3"/><line x1="20" x2="20" y1="21" y2="16"/><line x1="20" x2="20" y1="12" y2="3"/><line x1="2" x2="6" y1="14" y2="14"/><line x1="10" x2="14" y1="8" y2="8"/><line x1="18" x2="22" y1="16" y2="16"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Guardrails, set per agent</h3>
      <p>For each shared agent, choose which apps and which AI models it may use. Everyone still picks their own model within what you allow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mp-card">
      <span class="mp-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h6"/><path d="M8 21h4"/><path d="M2 9V5"/><rect width="10" height="12" x="12" y="9" rx="2"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Web or desktop, one set of spaces</h3>
      <p>Reach the same team spaces from the desktop app or the web. Your agents and your missions are wherever you are.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mp-wide reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="media-slot media-slot-wide">
      <span class="media-slot-tag">AI image</span>
      <div class="media-slot-inner">
        <svg class="media-slot-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"/></svg>
        <p class="media-slot-cap">image: a team's shared mission board, with teammate avatars on missions moving across running, needs you, and done</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
